<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">Mikah</book>
  <para style="h">Mikah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mikah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mikah</para>
  <para style="mt">Mikah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jotham, Ahaz le Hezekiah in Judah siangpahrang an rak ṭuan laiah Moresheth khua mi Mikah hnenah Bawipa ih ṭongkam a ra thleng. Samaria le Jerusalem thuhla ah Bawipa in Mikah hnenah a run langtermi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rak ngai uh, nannih miphun pawl, Leilung parih mi hmuahhmuah in rak thei uh. Cungnungbik Bawipa in a lo mawhthluk a si; Ngai uh, vancung a biakinn ihsin thu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu a hmun thianghlim ihsin a ra lai; Tlangzim par ihsin a rung ṭum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ke thuaiah tlang pawl cu meisa sungih khuailul bangin an tlorh ding; Phairawn pawl khal an puak kuai ding ih tlangpar in tidai a luan bangin horkuam sungah an luang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thil pawl cu a kim ding, ziangahtile Israel mi pawl an sualih Pathian an dodal ruangah a si. Israel ih sualnak hi zo mawhthluk ding so a si? An khawpi bik Samaria rori mawhthluk ding a si. Judah ram sungih milem biaknak a um hi zo mawhthluk ding so a si? Amah Jerusalem a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in, “Samaria cu phuul lakih khawrop le sabit hri cinnakah ka canter ding. Khua dawlnak lungto pawl cu horkuam sungah ka hril ṭheh ding ih khua hramṭohnak lung phum pawl cu ka langter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An sunloih zetmi milem pawl ka vuakkuai ṭheh ding ih an biakinn hlawhhlang pawl an pekmi thil hmuahhmuah meisa in ka ur ṭheh ding. An milem pawl cu hnawmpen ah an cang ṭheh ding. Samaria in hi thil pawl cu hlawhhlan man ah a ngah ih atu-ah cu pawl cu a ral pawl in hlawhhlang man ah hmun dangah an pek ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Mikah in, “Hiti a si ruangah kei cu riahsia in ka ṭap ding. Ka riahsiatnak langternak ah ka ke lawngin le ka lawngfangkheh in ka vak rero ding. Cinghnia bangin riahsia in ka bo ding ih kalauk vate bangin lungleng in ka ai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samaria ih hma cu damter a theih nawn lo; Judah khal cuvek thotho in a tuar ding. Siatsuahnak cu ka minung pawl an umnak Jerusalem kotka a thleng zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ral ih in nehzia hi Gath ih um kan ral pawl sim hlah uh; kan ṭah rero hi hmu hlah hai seh. Maw Beth Leafrah khua mi pawl, nan riahsiatnak cu leivut lakah ril tahrat in langter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Shafir khua mi tla, taklawng le ningzak in sal ah feh uh. Zaanan khua ih a ummi pawl cu an khua in an suak ngam lo. Bethezel khua mi pawl an riahsiatnak nan theih tikah cutawkah beunak a um lo ti thei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in harsatnak cu Jerusalem khua kiangte tiang a thlenter zo ruangah Maroth khua mi pawl cu bomnak ngah ding an hngakhlap zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nannih Lakhish ih a ummi pawl, rang pawl cu rangleng ah ṭemcih uh. Nannih in Israel sualnak nan cawng ih cuti cun Jerusalem nan sualter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah, maw Judah mi pawl, Moresheth Gath khua cu ṭhen awknak laksawng nan pek a ṭul ding. Akzib khua cu Israel siangpahrang pawl hrangah cun bumnak lawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Mereshah mi pawl, nan ral in nan khua an la ding ih Bawipa in nan ral kut sungah a lo thlenter ding. Israel hruaitu pawl cu an tlan ding ih Adullam lungpuk ah an relh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Judah mi pawl, nan fahniang pawl nan ngai ruangah riahsia in nan sam meet uh. Nan faale pawl cu sal ah an kai ding ih ramdang ih an fehpi ding ruangah nan lu cu langta lu bangin meet kolh thluh uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ihkhun parah zau tahratin thil ṭha lo tuah ding khua a khang rerotu pawl cu nan hmakhua a va pit so! Khua a hung vang ih tikcu ṭha an ngah vete in thil ṭha lo an ruahmi cu an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lo an duh tikah mi ih lo an long. Inn an duh tikah mi ih inn an luah mai. Zo ih innsang le thilri hman a him lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in hiti in a ti, “Nan parah thil ṭha lo ka thlenter ding ih zohman nan luat thei lo ding.Awloksong le vansaang in nan um ding ih hngalhngawng zet cun nan tlang nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih tikcu a thlen tikah siatnak nan tonmi cu mi tampi in thuṭhimnak ah an hmang ding ih hi nan thinnatnak hla hi an sak ding: ‘Siatsuah ṭheh kan si zo, Bawipa in kan ram a lak zo; Sal ih in kaitu pawl hnenah a pek,’ an ti ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule hi ram cu Bawipa ih minung hnenih pek sal a si tikah nannih hrangah cun co ding zianghman a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Misenpi in ka hnenah, “Thu in sim duh hlah. Cuih thu pawl cu a rel in rel nawn hlah. Pathian cun mual in photer zik lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi pawl hi camsiatnak hnuai ah an um tiah maw si na ruah? Pathian cu a thin a sau thei nawn lo tiah na ruat maw si? Cuvek thil cu a tuah ngaingai pei maw? Thil ṭha a tuahtu pawl hnen ahcun ṭong thlum in a ṭong ṭheu a si lo maw?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl cu nan ral vek in nan do. Raldonak ihsin an rung tlung ih kan inn ah himte in kan um tiah an ruat; asinain nannih in an taksa parih angki fual hman kha ru dingah nan rak bawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka miphun ih nupinu pawl cu an duhmi an inn nuamzet ihsin nan dawi suak ih an faale pawl hnen ihsin ka thlawsuah kha nan laksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah tho uhla feh uh; hitawk ah humhimnak malte hman a um nawn lo. Nan sualnak in hi hmun cu a siatter ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hi minung pawl ih duhmi profet cu sukso ah tawivak tahratin thuphan le mi bumnak lawng rel ih, ‘Nan hrangah cun sabitti le zu an luang ringring ko ding,’ a ti hluahhlotu khi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla a taang hrihmi Israel pawl nannih cu hmunkhat ah ka lo finkhawm ding. Tuu innih a tlungmi tuu vekin hmunkhat ah ka lo tlunter ding. Ṭilva tlannak ramih tuu an khah vekin nan ram cu minung in an khat sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in lamzin a sial ding ih an saltaannak hmun ihsin a hruaisuak ding. Khawpi kotka pawl cu an bauh ding ih an suak ding. An siangpahrang Bawipa amah rori in a suahpi hai ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel uktu pawl tla ngaihnik uh! Dingthluk lairelnak a duhtu ding nan si naón,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭhatnak a huatu le siatnak a duhtu riangri nan si. Ka minung pawl cu nungcung in an vun nan hawk ih an ruh ihsin an tit nan filh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka minung pawl ih sa nan ei ṭheh. An vun nan hawk ih an ruh nan khiah hnuah beel ih suan dingah nan saattan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa hnenih nan au ciamco tikcu a ra thleng leh ding. Asinain a lo sawn lo ding. Thil siava nan tuah ruangah nanmah lam zoh loin hmun dang a lo hoisan hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangka petu hnenah daihnak a um ding tiah thu a kam ih tangka pe lotu hnenah cun ral a tlung ding tiih mi a hrotu profet pawl in ka minung pawl cu an bum ṭheh a si. Hi vek profet pawl hnenah Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Maw profet pawl, nan tikcu a cem zik thlang. Ni in a lo liamsan cing ding. Zan in a lo khuh hai ding. Langnak nan hmu nawn lo ding ih hmailam thu phuan theinak zianghman nan nei nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmailam thu a simtu pawl cu an simmi a kim lo ruangah mualpho in an um ding. Pathian in an thu a let lo ruangah an zatein ningzak in an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kei cu Israel mi an sualnak ziang a si ti sim dingah Bawipa in thlarau le huham thawn i khahter ih dingte ih thuṭhen theinak le ralṭhatnak i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Israel uktu pawl, dingthluk lairelnak a hua ih thil ṭha kha thil ṭha loih a cantertu nannih pawl i ngaihnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian ih khawpi Jerusalem cu mithahnak le dinglonak parah nan sak rero a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawpi uktu bawi pawl in nawhthuh duh ah thu an ṭhen; puithiam pawl in sum ngah duh ah Daan cabu an hrilhfiah ih profet pawl in tangka duh ah hmailam thu an phuang; cule an zatein, “Kan hnenah Bawipa a um,” an ti ṭheh. “Kan parah thil poimawh zianghman a thleng lo ding. Bawipa cu kan hnenah a um a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi bangtuk nan si ruangah Zion cu lo bangin lei ah leh ṭheh a si ding. Jerusalem khua cu khawrop ah a cang ding ih Biakinn umnak tlang cu tupi ah a cang ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmailam tikcu ahcun Bawipa ih Biakinn dinnak tlang cu, Tlang hmuahhmuah lakah a saangbik a si ding. Miphun tampi in ti luang bangin an pan dutdo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih minung pawl cun,” Bawipa ih tlang ah hung feh uhsi, Israel Pathian ih Biakinn ahcun; Tuahter in duhmi cu kan zir ding ih A hrangih a hrilciami lamzin ahcun kan feh ding,” an ti ding. Bawipa ih thuzirhnak cu Jerusalem ihsin a ra ih Zion ihsin a minung hnenah thu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah cu miphun tampi lakah thuṭhentu a si ding ih, A hlat le a nai miphun cak zetzet karlakah lai a rel ding. An ralnam cu leilehnak tuhmui ah an ser ding ih, An feipi cu thingfa cehnak cehrep ah an tuah ding. Miphun pakhat le pakhat an do aw nawn lo ding ih, Raldo daan khal an zir nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zozo khal hnangam zetin an um ding ih, An sabit hmuan le an theipi kung lakah cun Zohman in an thin an phanter nawn lo ding. Cungnungbik Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miphun kip in anmah ih khawzing ciar biak in a thu an thlun ciar; sikhalsehla kannih cun Bawipa kan Pathian kan biak ding ih kumkhua in a thu kan thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka hremmi pawl cu hmunkhat ah ka finkhawmnak caan le ralkaihnak hmun ih a tuar zettu pawl ka kawhkhawmnak tikcu a ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ke-awl mi an si naón a taangsun ka miphun ah ka tuah ding. Dawihlomi an si naón a thar in ka thawhpi sal hai ding ih miphun tumzet ah an cang ding. Zion Tlang ah cuih caan ihsin a kumkhua in ka uk hai ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang Jerusalem, Pathian in tuukhal bangtuk in a minung pawl a kilvennak hmun, nang cu na ram uknak sungih khawpi bikah na cang sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ziangah so ringzet in na ṭah ciamco? Ziangah so nau neizik nunau bangin na tuar ciamco? Siangpahrang na neih nawn lo ruangah maw? Thuron dingmi na neih nawn lo ruangah a si maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Zion fanu pawl, nau neizik bangin ṭhia thlohthlo in ai rero uh; ziangahtile hi khawpi ihsin nan suak ding ih hramlak ah nan um ding. Babilon ah nan feh ding a si. Sikhalsehla cutawk ihsin run suak nan si ding ih Bawipa in nan ral pawl ih kut sungin a lo hum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miphun tampi nanmah do dingah an ṭangkhawm. Annih in, “Jerusalem cu siatṭheh ding a si! Hnawmpen ah cang ṭheh sehla kan zoh ding!” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain hi miphun pawl in Bawipa ih thinlung sungah ziang a um ti an thei lo. Fang cu ciil ding ih an khawm ṭheu bangin Bawipa in annih pawl cu hrem dingih a finkhawm ṭheh hi an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Jerusalem mi pawl, feh uhla nan ral pawl hrem hai uh. Thir ki le dar ketin a neimi cawcang bangin ka lo cakter ding. Miphun tampi nan rialdip ding ih thisen suah tahrat ih an ngahmi lennak pawl cu leilung pumpi in Bawipa keimah ih hnenah nanmah in in pe ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem mi pawl, nan ralkap hmunkhat ah finkhawm uh! In kulh ṭheh zo! Israel hotu cu a biang ah thirfung in an thawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Bethlehem Efratah, nang cu Judah peng ah khawfate bik pakhat na si naón na sungin Israel uktu ka suahter ding. A suahseemnak cu khuahlan lai, a liam zomi san ihsin a rak thok zo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuticun Bawipa in a minung pawl cu fa neitu ding nu in fapa a neih hlan sung hmuah an ral pawl kut sungah a taanta ding. Cuih hnuah a unau ralkaihnak hmun ih a ummi pawl thawn an kom aw sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah a rat tikah cun Bawipa ih thazaang le Bawipa Pathian ih huham thawn a minung pawl a uk hai ding. Leilung pumpuluk ah mi hmuahhmuah in a maksak zia cu an hmuh ding ruangah amah ih minung pawl cu him zetin an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Daihnak a thlenpi ding a si. Assiria mi pawl in kan ram in do ih kan ṭanhmun an rung thlen tikah anmah do dingah kan hotu cak bik pawl kan thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An hriamnam thawn Assiria ram, Nimrod ih ram cu an va neh ding. Assiria pawl in kan ram an do tikah in humtu cu anmah an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi a taangsun pawl cu miphun tampi hrangah Bawipa ih run thlakmi daitla bangtuk an si ding; hrampi note hrangih ruahhmai bangtuk an si ding. Cupawl cun minung si loin Pathian an rinsan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mi ṭhenkhat miphun tampi lakah an taang ding ih tupi sung le ṭilva tlannak phuul lakih rawl hawl in a vak rero mi kiosa bangtuk an si ding. Kiosa cu tuurual lakah lut in a zon ih a bauhthlek ṭheh hai. Runsuah ngaihnak a um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuvekin Israel cun a ral tampi a neh ding ih a siatsuah ṭheh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Cuih ni ah nan rang pawl ka la ding ih nan rangleng pawl ka siatter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan khawpi pawl ka siat ṭheh ding ih nan ṭannak phardawl pawl cu ka bal ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nan dawithiam pawl ka hlon ṭheh ding ih nan pol pawl cu pakhat hman ka zuah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan milem pawl le nan biak rero mi nan lungphun zarh pawl ka balsiat ṭheh ding. Nanmah kut ih tuahmi thil ziangtik hman ah nan bia nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nan ram sungih Asherah lem pawl le nan khua pawl cu ka siatsuah ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka thu a thlun lotu miphun hmuahhmuah cu thinheng in an parah phuba ka la ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi parih mawhthluknak a neih mi hi ngaihnik uh! Maw Bawipa , tho awla na neihmi thu cu simhnik aw; tlang saangpipi le tlang niamtete in na thu cu thei hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nannih tlang saangpi pawl, nannih kumkhua hmun mi leilung hram ṭoh-nak pawl, Bawipa ih thu cu ngai uh! Bawipa in a minung parah thu a nei. Israel parih a neihmi thu a sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl, nan parah ziang tuahmi so ka neih? Ziangtin so nan hrangah thilrit ih ka can cu? I let hnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin ka lo runsuak ih saltaannak sungin ka lo tlensuak. Nanmah hruaitu dingah Moses le Aaron le Miriam ka thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka minung pawl, Moab siangpahrang Balak in nan parih thil tuah a tummi le Beor ih fapa Balaam in thu a lehnak pawl kha ciing ringring uh. Akasia ih riah hmun ihsin Gilgal fehnak lamzin ih thil a cangmi pawl kha thei ringring uh. Cuih thil pawl ciing ringring uhla nanmah hum duh ih thil ka rak tuahmi pawl cu nan thei sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vancung Pathian Bawipa bia dingih ka feh tikah a hnenah ziangso ka ken ding? A hnenih mei-ur thawinak pe dingah kum khat kim caw no ṭha ka hei keng ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuu a thawng le a za in pe ningla Bawipa cu a lung a awi pei maw? Cat loih a luangmi olif hriak in a lung a awiter pei maw? Ka sualnak ruangah a hnenah ka sung suak ka fatir ka pe ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asilo, Bawipa amah in a ṭhami le tuahter in duhmi cu in sim zo. Siter in duh mi cu: A dingmi tuah le zaangfahnak tlaihsan le tangdorte in Pathian thawn fehtlang khi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa ṭihzah cu fim a si. Bawipa in khawpi cu a ko ih, “Khawsungih a ummi pawl, ngai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih inn ahcun ṭhat lonak thawn an ngahmi sumsaw tampi a um. A dik lomi tahnak an hmang, ka huatmi thil a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A dik lomi tahnak le a dik lomi cuaithlainak a hmangtu pawl cu ziangtinso ka ngaithiam thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawsungih milian pawl cun mifarah pawl nan neekrawk ih nan zatein thuphan pertu hlir nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan sualnak ruangah nanmah siatsuahnak atu ihsin ka thok zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rawl cu nan ei ding naón nan puar lo ding; nan ril a rawng ringring ding. Thilri humsuak dingih nan tlanpi hmanah nan hlawhtling lo ding. Nan tlanpi suakmi a um pang hmanah ral kut in ka siatter ṭhiamṭhiam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rawlci nan tuh ding naón a rah cu nan la ngah lo ding. Olif rah ihsin siti nan rial ding naón hman ding cu nan nei dah lo ding. Sabitti nan tuah ding naón nan in dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siangpahrang Omri le a fapa siangpahrang Ahab ih thil ṭha lo tuahmi nan thlun zo a si. An taantami an thu cu nan thlun ṭhiamṭhiam ruangah siatnak ah ka lo thlenpi hai ding ih mi hmuahhmuah in an lo hmuhsuam ding. Khawzakip ih mi in nautatnak thawn an lo siatsuah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A va poi so! Rilrawng zetin thingkung parah thingrah hawl ih zianghman a ngah lotu le sabit hri parah sabit rah hawl ih a tong lotu ka bang. Theipi rah thawthaw le sabit rah hmuahhmuah cu an rak lo ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi ram sungah hin mifel pakhat hman an um lo; Pathian rinsantu pakhat hman an um lo. Mi thahnak tikcu lawng an bawh. Pakhat le pakhat zuarthlai aw dingin an bawh aw fingfing a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo tuahnak lam ahcun rintlak hlir an si. Hotu bawi le thuṭhentu pawl in nawhthuh an dil. Thil tithei pacang pawl in an duh mi an sim ih cuticun thil ṭha lo cu an rel tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An lakih miṭha bik hman hling vek a si ih mifel bik an timi cu so bangtuk a si. Profet hmangin Pathian in ralrinnak a sim zo bangin a minung pawl a hremnak tikcu a ra thleng ding. Atu-ah an buai celcel zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na inn hnen khal rinsan hlah; na rualpi khal zum hlah. Na nupi hnenih na ṭongmi hman ralring aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuvek tikcu ahcun fapa pawl in an pale pawl cu mi aa ah an ruat ding ih, fanu pawl in an nule pawl cu an dodal ding. Mo pawl cu an ni thawn an to aw ding ih zozo khal an ral cu anmah ih innsungsaangmi an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kei cun Bawipa ka thlir ding. Thlangamtein i runtu Pathian cu ka hngak ding ih amah in i hum ding. Ka Pathian cun ka aw a ngai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan ral pawl in kan parah direm ding zianghman an nei lo. Kan bah zo, asinain kan thosal ding. Thimnak sungah kan um, asinain Bawipa in tleunak in pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa ih parah kan sual zo ih tikcu tawkfang sung cu a thinhengnak kan tuar ding. Sikhalsehla a netnak ahcun amah in in ṭan ding ih kan tlunih thil dik lo an tuahmi cu dingnak thawn thu a ṭhen leh ding. Khawtleu ah amah in in suahpi ding ih in runnak kha kan hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah kan ral pawl, “ Bawipa nan Pathian cu khuiah so a si?” ti ih in nautat rerotu pawl in an hmu ding ih ningzak in an um ding. Kan ral pawl an sung ding ih lamzin ah ciarbek bangih palcih an si kha kan hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem mi pawl, nan khawpi sak salnak tikcu a ra thleng zik thlang. Cuih tikcu caanah nan ram cu kauhter sinsin a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nan minung pawl khuazakip in nan hnenah an ra kir ding: Nisuahnak lam Assiria ihsin, thlanglam Izipt ram ihsin le lam hlatzet tifinriat le tlang saangpipi ihsin an ra kir ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain cuih leiram pawl cu a parih umtu pawl ih sualnak le ṭhat lonak ruangah ramṭhingah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na hrilmi na minung pawl hi tuu bangin na kianghrol thawn khal hai aw. An kiangkap ram pawl cu ram ṭha zetzet an si naón annih ih umnak cu ramṭhing a si ih cutawkah anmah lawng an um. Ram ṭhatnak Bashan le Gilead ah feh hai sehla hlanlaipi ih an rak um bangin khopkham in um sal hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Izipt ram ihsin in suahpi lai caan ih na rak tuah bangin kan hrangah mangbangza tuah hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Miphun dang pawl in cumi cu an hmuh tikah ziangtluk ih micak an si hmanah an ning a zak ding. Beidong in an hmur an hup ding ih an hna an phit ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leivut lakah rul bangin an vak ding; leilung ih a vakmi cucik kharbok bangin! An ral ṭannak ralhruang ihsin khur thlohthlo in an ra suak ding. Ṭihnak thawn Bawipa kan Pathian hnenah an kir ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah vek Pathian zoso a um! A taangsun na minung pawl cu an sualnak na ngaidam a si. Kumkhua in na thin a heng lo; a hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu an parah na langter ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Atu khalah kan parah zaangfah lainatnak na nei sal ko ding. Kan sualnak cu na ke tangah na pal ding ih tifinriat ih tawne ah na hlonhlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuahlan laiah kan pupa Abraham le Jakob hnen ih thu na rak kam cia bangin an tesinfa, na minung Israel mi hnenah cun rinsan tlak na sizia le a hmunmi na duhdawtnak cu na langter ding a si.
  </para>
</usx>
